      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "加热容器中的液体时，液体体积变化使得液面升高，这是",
        "可以测量的. 液体的体胀系数一般比固体的体胀系数大得多，",
        "其数量级达到$10^{-3}$度$^{-1}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "地球上最常见的液体——",
        "水，在热膨胀方面具有特殊的",
        "性质. 它与其他液体不同，在",
        "0°C～4°C内加热时水的体积不",
        "增大，反而减小. 只有从4°C开",
        "始，温度升高时体积开始增大."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 100",
      "box": [
        843,
        404,
        520,
        350
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-100"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 100",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此可见，4°C时水的体积最小，而密度最大. 水的体积与温",
        "度的关系，如图100所示."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "水的这个性质对水库中热交换的特性有很大的影响. 当",
        "水冷却时，上层水的密度开始增大，并向下运动. 但是，达到",
        "4°C以后，进一步冷却时密度减小，从而较冷的水仍在表面.",
        "由此，甚至在气温很低时，水库深层的水温仍约为4°C."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**例 题**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 加热酒精时其体积增大$\\Delta V=5.5$厘米$^3$. 酒精的密度",
        "$\\rho=800$千克/米$^3$，体胀系数$\\alpha=1.1\\times10^{-3}$度$^{-1}$. 酒精的比热",
        "$c=2.4\\times10^3$焦耳/千克·度. 试求传给酒精多少热量？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**解**：酒精的初始体积$V_0$，加热以后体积等于$V=V_0(1+↵\\alpha\\Delta t)$，酒精体积的变化量"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\Delta V=V-V_0=V_0\\alpha\\Delta t$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "加热时传给酒精的热量$Q=cm\\Delta t$，式中$m=\\rho V_0$——酒",
        "精的质量."
      ]
    },
